3c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCHẤT LIỆU:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChất liệu Polyester Cool tuyệt vời cho mùa hè nóng ẩm ở Việt Nam.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSợi PE được xử lý với công nghệ tiên tiến Moisture Wicking tạo nên mặt cắt đặc biệt có các khoang rỗng trong sợi.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNhờ đó gia tăng khả năng thấm hút mồ hôi, thoáng khí, nhẹ hơn và khô nhanh hơn gấp 2 lần so với cotton, mang lại cảm giác mềm mượt, mát lạnh, dễ chịu cho cả ngày hoạt động.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMÀU SẮC:\u003c/strong\u003e Trắng 6 mesh, xanh biển 33 mesh, Xám 109 mesh, Đen 9 mesh\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSIZE: S – M – L – XL – XXL \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/80/c1/72/5076719b5729909b279fe5900bd676e0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1000\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/6e/40/42/4b5f901de18c4b17b2e3d6fee5a5b8cb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1000\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHướng dẫn chọn size phù hợp:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/6d/ce/b7/f01d302ac81dc26e84d560286c0e8de2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"343\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/97/cb/bc/b563c69a0569de9403054ae9b8bbde50.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1000\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/61/d2/ea/75739b6f5a374568552756cd8afa03f7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1000\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/19/c0/17/29ca220c29f19515d028de5a68fd7984.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1000\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/15/96/27/c5efbf68650f4b77172330ecc3144